From 3a409b3130cbe1fa945a6a00bd5c1ae86da0c315 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel King <dan@spiraldb.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 02:49:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] Reuse opened Vortex files on the table IO runtime

Bound metadata handle reuse to 128 immutable files and coalesce concurrent opens. Keep predicates and schema adaptation query-local, count cache IO cumulatively, and leave expression/pruning reader state scoped to each scan. Anchor persistent file drivers to the configured IO runtime so plans can move between runtimes.
